<title>AUSTRALIA: RTRS-Advance, St George share trading halted - ASX.</title>
<headline>RTRS-Advance, St George share trading halted - ASX.</headline>
<dateline>SYDNEY 1997-01-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Australian Stock Exchange said on Thursday trading halts would apply to the shares of Advance Bank Australia Ltd and St George Bank Ltd from 3.45 p.m. (0445 GMT) ahead of a court ruling at around 4 p.m. (0500 GMT) concerning their proposed merger.  </p>
<p>New South Wales Supreme Court judge Kim Santow is expected to hand down a judgement on the scheme of arrangement to merge Advance Bank and St George.</p>
<p>At 3.30 p.m. (0430 GMT), Advance shares were steady at A$7.00 and St George shares were four cents down at A$7.63.</p>
<p>-- Sydney newsroom 61-2 9373-1800</p>
</text>
